# --- Trace the Ace solution ---------------------------------------------------
# The template's blanket "/data/" rule is removed: data/interim, data/external and data/examples
# ship with the solution. Competition data stays out (never committed or shipped):
data/raw/*
!data/raw/README.md
data/processed/*
!data/processed/.gitkeep
# run outputs and environments
build/
# the base model, downloaded in Setup step 3 (16 GB)
models/huggingface_models/
.venv*/
